description	"Commander Fox

A security inclined commander with high synergy with Coruscant Guard and defensive units.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Fast Movement
- Overcharged Shock-Baton (Purple Style Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- 5 Swing Limit
-- Cripples/Stuns/Shocks/Tracks
-- Fast Movement
- Fox's DC-17 Clone Pistol (2)
-- 85% More Damage
-- 45% More FP Drain
-- 20% Slower RoF
-- Cripples On Hit
- Tactical Flash Bang (4)
-- Frag Grenade
-- 0 Damage, Large Radius
-- Flashes/Cripples/Tracks
- Containment Device (3)
-- Tripmine
-- Applies Tracking/Pulse/Pull/Cripple
-- Blinds Target

^8Attributes:
- Knockdown Roll
- Healing (3)
- Blast Armor
- Dexterity (1)
- 100% Slower Cooldowns
- Security Detail (Stat Viewer)
- Get Ups (3)
- Anti MT (2)
- Grapple Hop
- Tracking Beacon
- Melee Resist
- Rally
- 15% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3 Weapon]
- Tether Dart ^3[CS3 Melee]
-- Tracking Darts, Pulls/Cripples Target
- Shock Cord (Grapple Hook 2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
-- Shocks/Pulls/Slips/Tracks
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4 Weapon]
- Inform (Resource Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"
